    {
      "id": "06-vitamins",
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "vitamins",
      "text": "Vitamin C is 31% daily value, useful for collagen formation and antioxidant support. Vitamin A is only 1% daily value, not bringing much vision or immune support. For fruit, vitamin C and vitamin A are usually the vitamin scores that matter most.",
