    {
      "id": "07-minerals",
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "minerals",
      "text": "Magnesium is 5% daily value, the best number here but still too low to carry this section. Potassium is only 3% daily value, not bringing much fluid-balance support. For fruit, minerals are a bonus unless the numbers are unusually strong.",
