    {
      "id": "08-pros",
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "pros",
      "text": "Positives first: anthocyanin-rich berry pigments. The red-purple pigment story adds a food-specific antioxidant angle. Fuller texture helps real meals. That practical fullness is one reason it can work beyond the numbers. Sweet role is easy to understand. It can be useful when sweetness is the job and the portion is deliberate.",
